# Authors and Contributors

This file records authorship and contributor credit for Open Engineering Education® (OEE®).

Credit is separate from copyright ownership. Contributors retain copyright in their contributions unless they separately agree to an assignment.

## Originating author

- **Christopher S. Aondona** — originating author of the reference curriculum and specification material; current steward representative for OEE.

## Steward

- **0xBUFF®** — steward of OEE, responsible for maintaining the public standard, reference curriculum, governance records, and contribution process.

Stewardship does not, by itself, establish ownership of every contribution. Copyright ownership and assignments are governed by the applicable written agreements and notices.

## Contributors

Additional contributors should be listed here as their contributions are accepted.

Each addition should identify the contributor and, where useful, the nature of their contribution. Additions should be made through a reviewed pull request.

Contributors must follow the project's DCO process. See [CONTRIBUTING](governance/CONTRIBUTING.md) and [DCO](governance/DCO.md).